{
    "title": "Mermaid Games: Princess Salon",
    "description": "Embark on an exciting journey for kids/toddler in the undersea wonders of Princess Life Town! Explore the secrets of Bobo Mermaid Town Simulator, where you'll encounter new friends like the little mermaid princess, dolphin bobo prince, jellyfish pet girl, octopus queen, koi fish baby doll princess, and even a cat or a pony. Choose from a stunning array of outfits as you dive into this magical realm for kids/toddler.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nFree Exploration: Dive into all the secrets. Like the royal palace with cute cat and horse, Youth Spring, the witch's house, the salon room, and the undersea restaurant.\r\nAdventures with Friends: Join your favorite characters or pets in different locations. Dance in the palace with a girl, discover little creatures/pets, have a care salon or go on a thrilling treasure hunt!\r\nCreate Your Story: Craft new stories and shape your own fairytale world beneath the waves.\r\n\r\nInteractivity:\r\nCharacter Expressions: Give your character various expressions, let them move and dance, with endless possibilities limited only by your imagination.\r\nRich Customization: Choose from hundreds of faces, cute clothes, makeup, and little accessories to create your own unique baby. Take care of your characters!\r\nExplore 12 scenes with over 500 interactive items in this kids/toddler simulator game, such as care salon tools, horse, cat, unicorn, pony, and doll!\r\nStory Creation: Interact with every item, find unicorn's secrets, create character stories, and express your ideas. \r\n\r\nGameplay:\r\nNo Restrictions: Play various character roles and experience different lives with unlimited interaction possibilities. You may find a magical unicorn, pony, horse and dolls.\r\nContinuous Enjoyment: Discover hidden plots, salon, animations, new characters, and exciting events as you explore different locations.\r\n\r\nDive into the enchanting Baby Girl Mermaid Kingdom and the regal Bobo Princess Life Town Simulator for an immersive and cute experience!\r\n\r\nImportant Message for Purchases:\r\n- By downloading this App you agree to our Privacy Policy\r\n- Please consider that this App may include third parties services for limited legally permissible purposes.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to play and all content is FREE with ads. There are certain in-game features that may require purchase using real money.\r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\nThis is a high quality Educational Game Studio. Our goal is to bring fun, safe and exciting new educational gaming experiences to users.\r\n\r\nLearn more about us:\r\n- https://www.kidsfoodinc.com/\r\n- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIBxt5W2xpgofE9jOS6fXqQ/featured",
    "descriptionHTML": "Embark on an exciting journey for kids/toddler in the undersea wonders of Princess Life Town! Explore the secrets of Bobo Mermaid Town Simulator, where you&#39;ll encounter new friends like the little mermaid princess, dolphin bobo prince, jellyfish pet girl, octopus queen, koi fish baby doll princess, and even a cat or a pony. Choose from a stunning array of outfits as you dive into this magical realm for kids/toddler.<br><br>Features:<br>Free Exploration: Dive into all the secrets. Like the royal palace with cute cat and horse, Youth Spring, the witch&#39;s house, the salon room, and the undersea restaurant.<br>Adventures with Friends: Join your favorite characters or pets in different locations. Dance in the palace with a girl, discover little creatures/pets, have a care salon or go on a thrilling treasure hunt!<br>Create Your Story: Craft new stories and shape your own fairytale world beneath the waves.<br><br>Interactivity:<br>Character Expressions: Give your character various expressions, let them move and dance, with endless possibilities limited only by your imagination.<br>Rich Customization: Choose from hundreds of faces, cute clothes, makeup, and little accessories to create your own unique baby. Take care of your characters!<br>Explore 12 scenes with over 500 interactive items in this kids/toddler simulator game, such as care salon tools, horse, cat, unicorn, pony, and doll!<br>Story Creation: Interact with every item, find unicorn&#39;s secrets, create character stories, and express your ideas. <br><br>Gameplay:<br>No Restrictions: Play various character roles and experience different lives with unlimited interaction possibilities. You may find a magical unicorn, pony, horse and dolls.<br>Continuous Enjoyment: Discover hidden plots, salon, animations, new characters, and exciting events as you explore different locations.<br><br>Dive into the enchanting Baby Girl Mermaid Kingdom and the regal Bobo Princess Life Town Simulator for an immersive and cute experience!<br><br>Important Message for Purchases:<br>- By downloading this App you agree to our Privacy Policy<br>- Please consider that this App may include third parties services for limited legally permissible purposes.<br><br>Important Message to Parents<br>This app is free to play and all content is FREE with ads. There are certain in-game features that may require purchase using real money.<br><br>About Us<br>This is a high quality Educational Game Studio. Our goal is to bring fun, safe and exciting new educational gaming experiences to users.<br><br>Learn more about us:<br>- https://www.kidsfoodinc.com/<br>- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIBxt5W2xpgofE9jOS6fXqQ/featured",
